medications, my sleep improved and my bipolar disorder improved as well. So it's a thing to check out. Also, thyroid has, checking on my thyroid has been important that can impact my bipolar disorder. So there are all these interrelated factors. You need to live a healthy lifestyle. If you want to want to be healthy mentally, I think. Can I add to that as well? Yeah, if you would, yeah. Yeah. I agree with everything Terry said, and I think everything she said about alcohol could also

