because it certainly helps you to speed up a little bit, and your thoughts go faster, and you kind of think outside the box a little bit more when you're hypomanic. But when you get manic, I don't know if Terry would agree with this, but I think people produce a lot of work, but it's not their best work. Absolutely, I'd agree with that. When I'm hypomanic, I see connections between things. It's astonishing.

